      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The test has many unused imports, unused constants, and unused helper methods carried over from the full test class. The magic numbers `36204` (MJD of TAI epoch 1958-01-01) and `10` (initial TAI-UTC offset) are unexplained. I'll clean all of this up.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed all unused imports, constants, and helper methods; extracted the magic numbers `36204` and `10` into named constants `MJD_TAI_EPOCH` and `INITIAL_TAI_UTC_OFFSET_SECS` with explanatory comments; and kept only what's needed for the single test method."
